== Effects ==
* +0.3 [[damage]].
* Adds a 25% chance to fire acidic tears that destroy [[obstacles]] and open doors (including {{R|Secret Room}} entrances) upon contact.

== Notes ==
* Tears open only ''closed'' doors, not ''locked'' doors.
* The chance to fire an acid tear does not increase with [[luck]].
* The acidic tears affect static objects like {{E|Bomb}}s, but with some differences:
** They do not open {{E|Bomb Chest}}s.
** {{dlc|nr}} They cannot bridge gaps with obstacles.
*** {{dlc|r}} Gaps are now bridged.
** {{dlc|nr}} Poop is not destroyed in one hit.
** {{dlc|r}} The mirror leading to the [[Mirrored World]] cannot be destroyed.

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Brimstone}}/{{i|Tech.5}}/{{i|Technology}}/{{i|Technology 2}}/{{i|Tech X}}: Only the stat bonus applies to the laser.
** {{dlc|r}} Lasers will sometimes destroy rocks, but will not open doors or secret rooms and has no color change.
** {{dlc|r+}} Lasers can sometimes destroy rocks and doors. Still no color change.
* {{t|Broken Padlock}}: Locked doors can be opened by shooting at them.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}/{{i|Epic Fetus}}/{{i|Ipecac}}: Overrides Sulfuric Acid, stat bonus still applies.
* {{i|Finger!}}: The finger can destroy rocks when pointing at them.
* {{i|Spirit Sword}}: Only the energy beams can destroy rocks.
* {{C|The Forgotten}}: Only the boomerang attack can destroy obstacles, not swings.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: The Ludovico tear occasionally becomes acidic.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Mom's Knife}}: Overrides Sulfuric Acid, stat bonus still applies.
** {{dlc|r}} Knife can destroy obstacles and open doors and secret rooms upon contact with no visual indicator.
* {{i|Rubber Cement|nr}}: Acidic tears can no longer break objects and doors and just bounce.
* {{dlc|nr}} [[Spectral tears]]: Acidic tears will no longer be able to destroy obstacles or open secret rooms.
** {{dlc|r}} Acidic tears break rocks and open secret rooms, without being broken themselves on impact.

